// Rebuilt: one mask slot per portrait, laid out exactly like
// net_characters.scr, so every silhouette lines up with its own art.
// The stock sheet had 13 slots and pointed blue and red at the base
// class, which only works when all three share a pose.

!Texture(s, i, i)
!HiddenInEditor(i)
!Rect(s, i, i, i, i)
!RectWithCorner(s, i, i, i, i, i, i)
!Whole(s)

